      "content": "hey so i just got my blood work back from the clinic and my inr is at 4.5... i'm supposed to be around 2.5ish. i'm kind of worried about bleeding out or something but i dont really want to drive back to the doctor today if i dont have to. is there anything i can take or eat to bring it back down quickly? like can i just take more Vit K or something to fix it?",
